# Securitron Squadron on the battlefield (turn 1, squad unpaid). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Lingering Souls: its two 1/1
# Spirit tokens are creature tokens Bot1 does not control, so Bot1's Squadron puts nothing on them. On turn 3 Bot1
# casts its own Lingering Souls: its two Spirits are creature tokens it controls, and each gets a +1/+1 counter as
# it enters, becoming 2/2 fliers (CR 603.2, 603.6a).

